### ========== Health Check ==========

### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8000/

### 注册用户
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 获取用户信息
GET http://localhost:8000/user/1

### 修改用户信息（改密码）
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": null,
  "password": "newpassword"
}

### 获取不存在用户（预期返回 error）
GET http://localhost:8000/user/9999

### 更新用户名
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new1"
}

###

### 同时更新用户名和邮箱
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new",
  "email": "New1@163.com"
}

###

### 更新密码
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "newpassword123"
}

###

### 更新成已存在的邮箱（预期返回 error）
PUT http://localhost:8000/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "existing@example.com"
}


### ========== Destination（全局目的地库）==========

### 创建目的地
POST http://localhost:8000/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tokyo",
  "description": "Japan capital, vibrant city",
  "rating": 5
}

### 获取所有目的地
GET http://localhost:8000/destinations

### 获取单个目的地
GET http://localhost:8000/destinations/1

### 获取不存在目的地（预期返回 error）
GET http://localhost:8000/destinations/9999

### 删除目的地
DELETE http://localhost:8000/destinations/4



### ========== Trip ==========

### 创建行程
POST http://localhost:8000/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "title": "Japan Trip 2025",
  "date_range": "2025-03-01 ~ 2025-03-10",
  "destinations_count": 0,
  "budget": 5000,
  "rating": 5,
  "status": "draft"
}

### 获取用户行程列表（最新2条）
GET http://localhost:8000/trips?user_id=1

### 获取用户最近所有行程
GET http://localhost:8000/trips/recent?user_id=1

### 获取单个行程
GET http://localhost:8000/trips/1

### 更新行程
PUT http://localhost:8000/trips/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Japan Trip 2025 Updated",
  "status": "completed",
  "budget": 6000
}

### 获取不存在行程（预期返回 error）
GET http://localhost:8000/trips/9999

### 删除行程
DELETE http://localhost:8000/trips/3


### ========== TripDestination（行程内目的地）==========

### 向行程添加第1个目的地（第1天）
POST http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shinjuku",
  "description": "Famous shopping and entertainment district",
  "day_number": 1,
  "budget": 300,
  "actual_cost": 0
}

### 向行程添加第2个目的地（第2天）
POST http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shibuya",
  "description": "Iconic crossing and youth culture hub",
  "day_number": 2,
  "budget": 200,
  "actual_cost": 0
}

### 向行程添加第3个目的地（最简请求，使用默认值）
POST http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asakusa"
}

### 向不存在行程添加目的地（预期 404）
POST http://localhost:8000/trips/9999/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Destination"
}

### 获取行程所有目的地（按天数排序）
GET http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations

### 更新行程目的地
PUT http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shinjuku (Updated)",
  "description": "Also great for nightlife",
  "day_number": 1,
  "budget": 350,
  "actual_cost": 320
}

### 只更新实际花费（部分更新）
PUT http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actual_cost": 180
}

### 更新不存在的目的地（预期 404）
PUT http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost"
}

### 删除行程目的地
DELETE http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/3

### 删除不存在的目的地（预期 404）
DELETE http://localhost:8000/trips/1/destinations/9999


### ========== Statistics ==========

### 获取用户统计数据
GET http://localhost:8000/stats?user_id=1